  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "This unusual small-leaved purple-red dwarf from New Jersey arose from a witches' broom and looks somewhat like 'Shaina', but differs in its very slow, narrowly upright growth. Under normal garden conditions, it takes approximately 10 years to reach 2 ft. (60 cm) tall. The name honors the city where it was selected."
